sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Leaflet as Leaflet.VectorGrid (browser)
    participant Martin as Martin (port 3000)
    participant PostGIS as PostgreSQL/PostGIS (port 5432)

    User->>Leaflet: Pan / zoom the map
    Leaflet->>Leaflet: Compute visible tiles {z}/{x}/{y} (if zoom >= 8)
    Leaflet->>Martin: GET /parcelles/{z}/{x}/{y}

    Martin->>PostGIS: Spatial query (ST_AsMVT on bio.parcelles)
    PostGIS-->>Martin: Geometries + attributes (via GiST index)

    Martin-->>Leaflet: MVT tile (Protocol Buffer)
    Leaflet->>Leaflet: Decode tile, apply style (fillOpacity 0.15, weight 0.5)
    Leaflet-->>User: Render parcels on map

    User->>Leaflet: Clicks on a parcel
    Leaflet->>Leaflet: Read e.layer.properties (already in the received tile)
    Leaflet-->>User: Show popup with parcel attributes
